{"id": "EUVD-2026-59726", "enisaUuid": "b6c82192-42a9-3866-bfea-fe8f34543f69", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: ISO: fix race of kfree vs kref_get_unless_zero\n\nhci_conn::iso_data is accessed and modified without lock or RCU.\nThis leads to a race\n\n    [Task hdev->workqueue]                 \t[Task 2]\n    iso_recv                                    iso_conn_put(conn)\n      conn = LOAD hcon->iso_data                  iso_conn_free(conn)\n      iso_conn_hold_unless_zero(conn)               hcon->iso_data = NULL\n                                                    kfree(conn)\n        kref_get_unless_zero(&conn->ref) /* UAF */\n\nand also to races in iso_conn_add() vs. iso_conn_free().\n\nFix by adding spinlock hci_conn::proto_lock and using it to guard\nhci_conn::iso_data.", "datePublished": "2026-08-15T12:27:47", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:45:49", "baseScore": 8.8, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/08ac98f18c8d24cc037858dd6fba2670155e4e84", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/876a3e94c70d0859d1dad1c986112d4f0d99eba8", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/af24e338bf5dafb80f42baa9a0b9e9b57b1c5d9c"], "aliases": ["GHSA-xf88-xmxw-hhch", "CVE-2026-74533"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0151e094-985e-3dbb-817b-e706e8ad8f2d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "a58d0f5dac322e16cc75334d000666512341bde5 <08ac98f18c8d24cc037858dd6fba2670155e4e84"}, {"id": "025f1ae6-83b9-3f60-b00b-2e21793ccc60", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.11.11 <6.12"}, {"id": "1ab03d43-d835-3fab-92fb-41f703981366", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "2c15dd83-1746-3434-ac0e-4f25f6321dc9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.114"}, {"id": "5abb728e-8787-3d5d-8731-4cbb66431c49", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.13"}, {"id": "6009a769-f413-3d43-8d7b-1389575b0d2e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "dc26097bdb864a0d5955b9a25e43376ffc1af99b <af24e338bf5dafb80f42baa9a0b9e9b57b1c5d9c"}, {"id": "7757e47a-4d46-3e23-bb2a-a7ee2c49c0c8", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.1.8"}, {"id": "9b5279dd-ee20-3729-aff7-7ba397452858", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "f53e7489273dc2bb307bf50f319b3762d45534f0"}, {"id": "a2d0c445-01e6-372f-bad7-bb6a69294e7e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "dc26097bdb864a0d5955b9a25e43376ffc1af99b <876a3e94c70d0859d1dad1c986112d4f0d99eba8"}, {"id": "cb0b8bb2-e094-35de-8550-14c36ecce4f9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.12.2 <6.12.114"}, {"id": "cf3c884a-768f-32d0-9710-fa9912577aa8", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "bbaf79ef-b556-3282-baca-5d42cecf235f", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}